        name: 'create',
        docs: '```coffeescript [specscript]\n' +
          'create() -> indexData Promise<{\n' +
          '  IndexArn: string,\n' +
          '  IndexName: string,\n' +
          '  IndexStatus: string,\n' +
          '  KeySchema: [\n' +
          "    { AttributeName: string, KeyType: 'HASH' },\n" +
          "    { AttributeName: string, KeyType: 'RANGE' },\n" +
          '  ]\n' +
          '  BillingModeSummary: {\n' +
          "    BillingMode: 'PAY_PER_REQUEST'|'PROVISIONED',\n" +
          '  },\n' +
          '  ProvisionedThroughput: {\n' +
          '    ReadCapacityUnits: number,\n' +
          '    WriteCapacityUnits: number,\n' +
          '  },\n' +
          '}>\n' +
          '```\n' +
          '\n' +
          'Creates the DynamoDB Global Secondary Index.\n' +
          '\n' +
          'Arguments:\n' +
          '  * (none)\n' +
          '\n' +
          'Return:\n' +
          '  * `IndexArn` - the ARN (Amazon Resource Name) of the Global Secondary Index.\n' +
          '  * `IndexName` - the name of the Global Secondary Index.\n' +
          '  * `IndexStatus` - the currentn status of the Global Secondary Index.\n' +
          '  * `KeySchema` - the [key schema](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/amazondynamodb/latest/APIReference/API_KeySchemaElement.html) of the Global Secondary Index.\n' +
          '  * `BillingModeSummary` - information about the read/write capacity mode of the Global Secondary Index.\n' +
          '    * `BillingMode` - a mode that controls how read and write throughput is billed and how DynamoDB manages capacity for the Global Secondary Index.\n' +
          '  * `ProvisionedThroughput` - information about the provisioned throughput settings of the Global Secondary Index.\n' +
          '    * `ReadCapacityUnits` - number of 4KB strong reads per second.\n' +
          '    * `WriteCapacityUnits` - number of 1KB writes per second.\n' +
          '\n' +
          'Billing Modes:\n' +
          '  * `PAY_PER_REQUEST` - on-demand capacity mode. The AWS account is billed per read and write request.\n' +
          '  * `PROVISIONED` - a capacity mode where the reads (RCUs) and writes (WCUs) are predefined.\n' +
          '\n' +
          '```javascript\n' +
          "const awsCreds = await AwsCredentials('my-profile')\n" +
          "awsCreds.region = 'us-east-1'\n" +
          '\n' +
          'const myTable = new DynamoDBTable({\n' +
          "  name: 'my-table'\n" +
          "  key: [{ id: 'string' }],\n" +
          '  ...awsCreds,\n' +
          '})\n' +
          'await myTable.ready\n' +
          '\n' +
          'const myTypeTimeGSI = new DynamoDBGlobalSecondaryIndex({\n' +
          "  table: 'my-table',\n" +
          "  key: [{ type: 'string' }, { time: 'number' }],\n" +
          '  ...awsCreds,\n' +
          '  autoReady: false,\n' +
          '})\n' +
          '\n' +
          'await myTypeTimeGSI.create()\n' +
          '```\n' +
          '\n' +
          'References:\n' +
          ' * [AWS DynamoDB](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/amazondynamodb/latest/developerguide/Introduction.html)',
