        name: 'getItem',
        docs: '```coffeescript [specscript]\n' +
          'type DynamoDBJSONKey = {\n' +
          '  [hashKey string]: { S: string }|{ N: number }|{ B: Buffer },\n' +
          '  [sortKey string]: { S: string }|{ N: number }|{ B: Buffer },\n' +
          '}\n' +
          'type DynamoDBJSONObject = Object<\n' +
          '  [key string]: { S: string }\n' +
          '                |{ N: number }\n' +
          '                |{ B: Buffer }\n' +
          '                |{ L: Array<DynamoDBJSONObject> }\n' +
          '                |{ M: Object<DynamoDBJSONObject> }\n' +
          '>\n' +
          '\n' +
          'getItem(Key DynamoDBJSONKey) -> data Promise<{ Item: DynamoDBJSONObject }>\n' +
          '```\n' +
          '\n' +
          'Retrieves an item from a DynamoDB Table using DynamoDB JSON format.\n' +
          '\n' +
          'Arguments:\n' +
          '  * `Key` - the primary key in DynamoDB JSON format of the item to retrieve.\n' +
          '\n' +
          'Return:\n' +
          '  * `data`\n' +
          '    * `Item` - the full item in DynamoDB JSON format.\n' +
          '\n' +
          '```javascript\n' +
          "const awsCreds = await AwsCredentials('my-profile')\n" +
          "awsCreds.region = 'us-east-1'\n" +
          '\n' +
          'const env = process.env.NODE_ENV\n' +
          '\n' +
          'const userTable = new DynamoDBTable({\n' +
          '  name: `${env}_user`,\n' +
          "  key: [{ id: 'string' }]\n" +
          '  ...awsCreds,\n' +
          '})\n' +
          'await userTable.ready\n' +
          '\n' +
          "const data = await userTable.getItem({ id: { S: '1' } })\n" +
          "console.log(data) // { Item: { id: { S: '1' }, name: { S: 'Name' } } }\n" +
          '```\n' +
          '\n' +
          'References:\n' +
          ' * [AWS DynamoDB](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/amazondynamodb/latest/developerguide/Introduction.html)',
